{"seq":3,"slug":"homebrew-and-package-managers","title":"包管理器分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/testing-and-publishing/homebrew-and-package-managers","wordCount":615,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"包管理器分发\">包管理器分发</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>包管理器分发</strong>指把 CLI 工具发布到 Homebrew、Scoop、apt 等渠道，让用户用一条命令完成安装、更新与卸载，无需手动下载与配置 PATH。它的本质是<strong>把&quot;安装&quot;这一复杂过程委托给渠道维护</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>渠道</th>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>安装命令</th>\n<th>适合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Homebrew</td>\n<td>macOS/Linux</td>\n<td><code>brew install mytool</code></td>\n<td>macOS 开发者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Scoop</td>\n<td>Windows</td>\n<td><code>scoop install mytool</code></td>\n<td>Windows 开发者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>apt/deb</td>\n<td>Debian/Ubuntu</td>\n<td><code>apt install mytool</code></td>\n<td>Linux 服务器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>yum/rpm</td>\n<td>CentOS/Fedora</td>\n<td><code>yum install mytool</code></td>\n<td>Linux 服务器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cargo install</td>\n<td>跨平台</td>\n<td><code>cargo install mytool</code></td>\n<td>Rust 开发者</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>用包管理器分发的前提是<strong>已有可下载的预编译二进制</strong>（通常来自上一节的 Release），再由各渠道的清单文件（Formula、Manifest）描述如何获取与安装。本文依次介绍这些渠道。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要包管理器\">为什么需要包管理器</h2><p>将 CLI 工具发布到<strong>包管理器</strong>（Package Manager）能大幅降低用户的安装门槛。用户只需一条命令即可安装、更新和卸载工具，无需手动下载、解压和配置 PATH。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>包管理器</th>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>安装命令</th>\n<th>用户群体</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Homebrew</td>\n<td>macOS/Linux</td>\n<td><code>brew install mytool</code></td>\n<td>开发者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Scoop</td>\n<td>Windows</td>\n<td><code>scoop install mytool</code></td>\n<td>Windows 开发者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>apt/deb</td>\n<td>Debian/Ubuntu</td>\n<td><code>apt install mytool</code></td>\n<td>Linux 服务器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>yum/rpm</td>\n<td>CentOS/Fedora</td>\n<td><code>yum install mytool</code></td>\n<td>Linux 服务器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cargo install</td>\n<td>跨平台</td>\n<td><code>cargo install mytool</code></td>\n<td>Rust 开发者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>npm install -g</td>\n<td>跨平台</td>\n<td><code>npm install -g mytool</code></td>\n<td>Node.js 开发者</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[CLI 工具] --&gt; B{目标用户}&#10;    B --&gt;|macOS 开发者| C[Homebrew]&#10;    B --&gt;|Windows 开发者| D[Scoop]&#10;    B --&gt;|Linux 服务器| E[apt/yum]&#10;    B --&gt;|Rust 开发者| F[crates.io]&#10;    B --&gt;|Node.js 开发者| G[npm]\">graph TD\n    A[CLI 工具] --&gt; B{目标用户}\n    B --&gt;|macOS 开发者| C[Homebrew]\n    B --&gt;|Windows 开发者| D[Scoop]\n    B --&gt;|Linux 服务器| E[apt/yum]\n    B --&gt;|Rust 开发者| F[crates.io]\n    B --&gt;|Node.js 开发者| G[npm]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"homebrew-formula\">Homebrew Formula</h2><p><strong>Homebrew</strong> 是 macOS 和 Linux 上最流行的包管理器。发布 Homebrew formula 需要创建一个描述安装过程的 Ruby 脚本。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ruby\" data-code=\"class Mytool &lt; Formula&#10;  desc &quot;高性能命令行开发工具&quot;&#10;  homepage &quot;https://github.com/myorg/mytool&quot;&#10;  version &quot;1.0.0&quot;&#10;  license &quot;MIT&quot;&#10;&#10;  on_macos do&#10;    if Hardware::CPU.arm?&#10;      url &quot;https://github.com/myorg/mytool/releases/download/v1.0.0/mytool-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz&quot;&#10;      sha256 &quot;abc123...&quot;&#10;    else&#10;      url &quot;https://github.com/myorg/mytool/releases/download/v1.0.0/mytool-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.gz&quot;&#10;      sha256 &quot;def456...&quot;&#10;    end&#10;  end&#10;&#10;  on_linux do&#10;    if Hardware::CPU.arm?&#10;      url &quot;https://github.com/myorg/mytool/releases/download/v1.0.0/mytool-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz&quot;&#10;      sha256 &quot;ghi789...&quot;&#10;    else&#10;      url &quot;https://github.com/myorg/mytool/releases/download/v1.0.0/mytool-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz&quot;&#10;      sha256 &quot;jkl012...&quot;&#10;    end&#10;  end&#10;&#10;  def install&#10;    bin.install &quot;mytool&quot;&#10;    generate_completions_from_executable(bin/&quot;mytool&quot;, &quot;completions&quot;)&#10;  end&#10;&#10;  test do&#10;    assert_match &quot;mytool&quot;, shell_output(&quot;#{bin}/mytool --version&quot;)&#10;  end&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Mytool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C; </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Formula</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  desc </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"高性能命令行开发工具\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  homepage </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://github.com/myorg/mytool\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  version </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  license </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MIT\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  on_macos </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Hardware</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CPU</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">arm?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      url </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://github.com/myorg/mytool/releases/download/v1.0.0/mytool-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      sha256 </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"abc123...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      url </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://github.com/myorg/mytool/releases/download/v1.0.0/mytool-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.gz\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      sha256 </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"def456...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  on_linux </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Hardware</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CPU</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">arm?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      url </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://github.com/myorg/mytool/releases/download/v1.0.0/mytool-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      sha256 </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ghi789...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      url </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://github.com/myorg/mytool/releases/download/v1.0.0/mytool-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      sha256 </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"jkl012...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> install</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bin.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"mytool\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    generate_completions_from_executable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mytool\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"completions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  test</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    assert_match </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mytool\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">shell_output</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">#{bin}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/mytool --version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">end</span></span></code></pre></div><p>发布 Homebrew formula 的两种方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>维护成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自有 Tap</td>\n<td>任何项目</td>\n<td>自行维护仓库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>homebrew-core</td>\n<td>流行项目</td>\n<td>需要 PR 审核</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 创建自有 Tap&#10;# 仓库名: github.com/myorg/homebrew-tools&#10;&#10;# 用户安装&#10;brew tap myorg/tools&#10;brew install mytool&#10;&#10;# 或一步到位&#10;brew install myorg/tools/mytool\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 创建自有 Tap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 仓库名: github.com/myorg/homebrew-tools</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 用户安装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tap</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myorg/tools</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mytool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或一步到位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myorg/tools/mytool</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"scoop-manifest\">Scoop Manifest</h2><p><strong>Scoop</strong> 是 Windows 上的命令行包管理器，manifest 使用 JSON 格式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;1.0.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;description&quot;: &quot;高性能命令行开发工具&quot;,&#10;  &quot;homepage&quot;: &quot;https://github.com/myorg/mytool&quot;,&#10;  &quot;license&quot;: &quot;MIT&quot;,&#10;  &quot;architecture&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;64bit&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://github.com/myorg/mytool/releases/download/v1.0.0/mytool-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip&quot;,&#10;      &quot;hash&quot;: &quot;sha256:abc123...&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;bin&quot;: &quot;mytool.exe&quot;,&#10;  &quot;checkver&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;github&quot;: &quot;https://github.com/myorg/mytool&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;autoupdate&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;architecture&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;64bit&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://github.com/myorg/mytool/releases/download/v$version/mytool-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"高性能命令行开发工具\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"homepage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://github.com/myorg/mytool\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"license\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MIT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"architecture\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"64bit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://github.com/myorg/mytool/releases/download/v1.0.0/mytool-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"hash\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sha256:abc123...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"bin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mytool.exe\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"checkver\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"github\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://github.com/myorg/mytool\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"autoupdate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"architecture\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"64bit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://github.com/myorg/mytool/releases/download/v$version/mytool-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"自动化-formula-生成\">自动化 Formula 生成</h2><p>手动维护 formula 容易出错，可以通过 CI 脚本自动生成。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::process::Command;&#10;use sha2::{Sha256, Digest};&#10;&#10;struct ReleaseAsset {&#10;    target: &amp;&#39;static str,&#10;    url: String,&#10;    sha256: String,&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn compute_sha256(path: &amp;str) -&gt; String {&#10;    let data = std::fs::read(path).unwrap();&#10;    let hash = Sha256::digest(&amp;data);&#10;    format!(&quot;{:x}&quot;, hash)&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn generate_formula(version: &amp;str, assets: &amp;[ReleaseAsset]) -&gt; String {&#10;    let mut formula = format!(r#&quot;class Mytool &lt; Formula&#10;  desc &quot;高性能命令行开发工具&quot;&#10;  homepage &quot;https://github.com/myorg/mytool&quot;&#10;  version &quot;{version}&quot;&#10;  license &quot;MIT&quot;&#10;&#10;&quot;#);&#10;&#10;    for asset in assets {&#10;        if asset.target.contains(&quot;apple-darwin&quot;) {&#10;            let arch = if asset.target.contains(&quot;aarch64&quot;) { &quot;arm?&quot; } else { &quot;intel?&quot; };&#10;            formula.push_str(&amp;format!(&#10;                r#&quot;  on_macos do&#10;    if Hardware::CPU.{arch}&#10;      url &quot;{url}&quot;&#10;      sha256 &quot;{sha256}&quot;&#10;    end&#10;  end&#10;&#10;&quot;#,&#10;                arch = arch,&#10;                url = asset.url,&#10;                sha256 = asset.sha256,&#10;            ));&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    formula.push_str(r#&quot;  def install&#10;    bin.install &quot;mytool&quot;&#10;  end&#10;&#10;  test do&#10;    assert_match &quot;mytool&quot;, shell_output(&quot;#{bin}/mytool --version&quot;)&#10;  end&#10;end&#10;&quot;#);&#10;&#10;    formula&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    println!(&quot;Formula 生成器就绪&quot;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::process::Command;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use sha2::{Sha256, Digest};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct ReleaseAsset {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    target: &#x26;'static str,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    url: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sha256: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn compute_sha256(path: &#x26;str) -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let data = std::fs::read(path).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let hash = Sha256::digest(&#x26;data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    format!(\"{:x}\", hash)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn generate_formula(version: &#x26;str, assets: &#x26;[ReleaseAsset]) -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut formula = format!(r#\"class Mytool &#x3C; Formula</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  desc \"高性能命令行开发工具\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  homepage \"https://github.com/myorg/mytool\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  version \"{version}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  license \"MIT\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"#);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for asset in assets {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if asset.target.contains(\"apple-darwin\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let arch = if asset.target.contains(\"aarch64\") { \"arm?\" } else { \"intel?\" };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            formula.push_str(&#x26;format!(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                r#\"  on_macos do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if Hardware::CPU.{arch}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      url \"{url}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      sha256 \"{sha256}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"#,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                arch = arch,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                url = asset.url,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                sha256 = asset.sha256,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    formula.push_str(r#\"  def install</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    bin.install \"mytool\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  test do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    assert_match \"mytool\", shell_output(\"#{bin}/mytool --version\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"#);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    formula</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"Formula 生成器就绪\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 GitHub Actions 在每次 Release 后自动更新 Homebrew Tap 仓库中的 formula 文件，实现完全自动化的发布流程。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"apt-yum-分发\">apt/yum 分发</h2><p>为 Debian/Ubuntu（apt）和 CentOS/Fedora（yum）发布需要构建 <code>.deb</code> 和 <code>.rpm</code> 包。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 使用 cargo-deb 构建 .deb 包&#10;cargo install cargo-deb&#10;cargo deb --target x86_64-unknown-linux-musl&#10;&#10;# 使用 cargo-generate-rpm 构建 .rpm 包&#10;cargo install cargo-generate-rpm&#10;cargo build --release --target x86_64-unknown-linux-musl&#10;cargo generate-rpm --target x86_64-unknown-linux-musl\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 cargo-deb 构建 .deb 包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cargo-deb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deb</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> x86_64-unknown-linux-musl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 cargo-generate-rpm 构建 .rpm 包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cargo-generate-rpm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> x86_64-unknown-linux-musl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> generate-rpm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> x86_64-unknown-linux-musl</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Cargo.toml 中的 deb 配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"[package.metadata.deb]&#10;maintainer = &quot;My Org &lt;dev@myorg.com&gt;&quot;&#10;copyright = &quot;2026, My Org&quot;&#10;license-file = [&quot;LICENSE&quot;, &quot;0&quot;]&#10;extended-description = &quot;高性能命令行开发工具&quot;&#10;section = &quot;utility&quot;&#10;priority = &quot;optional&quot;&#10;assets = [&#10;    [&quot;target/release/mytool&quot;, &quot;usr/bin/&quot;, &quot;755&quot;],&#10;    [&quot;completions/mytool.bash&quot;, &quot;usr/share/bash-completion/completions/mytool&quot;, &quot;644&quot;],&#10;    [&quot;man/mytool.1&quot;, &quot;usr/share/man/man1/mytool.1&quot;, &quot;644&quot;],&#10;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[package.metadata.deb]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>maintainer = \"My Org &#x3C;dev@myorg.com>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>copyright = \"2026, My Org\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>license-file = [\"LICENSE\", \"0\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>extended-description = \"高性能命令行开发工具\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>section = \"utility\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>priority = \"optional\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>assets = [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [\"target/release/mytool\", \"usr/bin/\", \"755\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [\"completions/mytool.bash\", \"usr/share/bash-completion/completions/mytool\", \"644\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [\"man/mytool.1\", \"usr/share/man/man1/mytool.1\", \"644\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>]</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>包格式</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>安装命令</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>.deb</td>\n<td>cargo-deb</td>\n<td><code>dpkg -i mytool.deb</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.rpm</td>\n<td>cargo-generate-rpm</td>\n<td><code>rpm -i mytool.rpm</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.apk</td>\n<td>手动构建</td>\n<td><code>apk add mytool</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((包管理器分发))&#10;    Homebrew&#10;      Ruby formula&#10;      自有 Tap&#10;      homebrew-core&#10;    Scoop&#10;      JSON manifest&#10;      自动更新&#10;    apt/yum&#10;      .deb 包&#10;      .rpm 包&#10;      cargo-deb&#10;    自动化&#10;      CI 生成 formula&#10;      sha256 校验&#10;      多架构支持\">mindmap\n  root((包管理器分发))\n    Homebrew\n      Ruby formula\n      自有 Tap\n      homebrew-core\n    Scoop\n      JSON manifest\n      自动更新\n    apt/yum\n      .deb 包\n      .rpm 包\n      cargo-deb\n    自动化\n      CI 生成 formula\n      sha256 校验\n      多架构支持</pre><ul>\n<li>包管理器分发让用户一条命令完成安装、更新和卸载</li>\n<li>Homebrew formula 是 macOS 分发的标准方式，自有 Tap 适合任何项目</li>\n<li>Scoop manifest 使用 JSON 格式，支持自动更新检测</li>\n<li>cargo-deb 和 cargo-generate-rpm 简化了 Linux 包的构建流程</li>\n<li>CI 应自动化 formula/manifest 的生成和发布，避免手动维护的遗漏</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"包管理器分发","id":"包管理器分发"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要包管理器","id":"为什么需要包管理器"},{"level":2,"text":"Homebrew Formula","id":"homebrew-formula"},{"level":2,"text":"Scoop Manifest","id":"scoop-manifest"},{"level":2,"text":"自动化 Formula 生成","id":"自动化-formula-生成"},{"level":2,"text":"apt/yum 分发","id":"apt-yum-分发"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"CI 与发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/testing-and-publishing/ci-and-release"},"next":{"title":"版本管理与迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/testing-and-publishing/versioning-and-migration"}}